{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19106370","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19106370","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1910637001:1":{"text":"这里怎么会有一道……门？海水正在向门内涌入。","source_cn":"这里怎么会有一道……门？海水正在向门内涌入。","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0x0C1112E39D0E3C08","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910637002:1":{"text":"我不喜欢这里的感觉……","source_cn":"我不喜欢这里的感觉……","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xEA98D11BCA982924","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910637003:1":{"text":"我们刚刚通过的海渊，名为厄瑞波斯。长者们曾为它留下歌谣...","source_cn":"我们刚刚通过的海渊，名为厄瑞波斯。长者们曾为它留下歌谣...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910637004:1":{"text":"这里的水压太大，我们深海族裔也很难下到渊底。如果不是<...","source_cn":"这里的水压太大，我们深海族裔也很难下到渊底。如果不是<...","status":"truncated_preview","hash_xxh64":"","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1910637005:1":{"text":"……这到底是什么地方？","source_cn":"……这到底是什么地方？","status":"hash_not_found","hash_xxh64":"0xC8A48FD8A50B25B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}